// Clermont County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-09
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * The county's school-districts page no longer loads; each district is listed
//     instead. Clermont County Public Health moved to clermonthealthohio.gov.
//   * Amelia (2019) and Newtonsville (2019) dissolved; Batavia and New Richmond
//     faced dissolution petitions in 2026 but are not on the ballot.
//   * The county took over the animal shelter from Clermont Animal CARE.
//   * Child Focus, not Clermont County Community Services, now runs Head Start.
//   * The Auditor is Tyler iasWorld Public Access (confirmed); the Auditor also
//     runs an open-data portal.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Clermont FLORIDA (near Orlando) dominates searches; Batavia NY/IL; Milford
//   CT/MA; loveland.org is Loveland, COLORADO. Union and Miami townships exist in
//   many Ohio counties. "Cincinnati 45244/45245" mailing addresses are in Union
//   Township, Clermont County.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * Cities Milford (mostly Clermont) and Loveland (mostly Hamilton, part
//     Clermont and Warren — flagged); eight villages with sites (Chilo has none)
//     and all fourteen townships.
//   * Loveland City and Blanchester Local districts take in parts of Clermont.
//   * Many bodies are regional: United Way of Greater Cincinnati, the YWCA, VITAS
//     hospice, and the Farm Bureau office shared with Adams, Brown and Highland.
//   * The Clermont Sun shares an office and owner with the Brown County papers.
//
// LEFT OUT rather than listed unverified: the Clermont County Historical Society
// and Owensville museum sites (do not load), Loveland Castle (county not
// confirmed), Loveland Magazine (dormant), the Enquirer community weeklies (only
// old archives), WKFS (no station page), and Freestore Foodbank and Habitat
// (their pages do not name Clermont).

